{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01P67G5MXbodvpANeJwnSsMd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: \"核心 finding (phase-dependent severity) 跨 GPQA 稳健复现，dose-response 单调递增 (ρ=1.0)。但 strategy specificity magnitude 从 MATH-500 的 15-17× 衰减至 GPQA 的 2-5×（与 GSM8K 同量级），确认 specificity 强度是 task-dependent 而非 universal constant。需将论文 C1 claim 拆分为 (a) phase gradient universality (strong, fully supported across 3 benchmarks) 和 (b) strategy specificity magnitude (qualified, context-dependent)。\"\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"GPQA DeepSeek Importance s020\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s020\"\n    description: \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B importance masking at s=0.20 on GPQA-Diamond (n≈198), measuring per-problem paired phase gradient\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      high_phase_median_ii: 0.038\n      mid_phase_median_ii: 0.285\n      low_phase_median_ii: 1.98\n      median_difference: 1.94\n      median_difference_ci: [1.72, 2.21]\n      wilcoxon_p: 2.5e-28\n      cohens_dz: 0.72\n      gradient_monotonic: true\n      perplexity_high_both: 2.85\n      perplexity_mid_both: 7.9\n      perplexity_low_both: 42.3\n    result_rationale: \"在 median 档位下，GPQA importance phase gradient 延续 s015 的强单调趋势。s015 已观测到 median_diff=0.947，s020 按 sub-exponential growth（约 2× 增长因子）预期达到 ~1.9。GPQA 推理链更长（平均 ~6000 tokens vs MATH-500 ~1200），低 sparsity phase 累积更多 compound interaction，但每 segment 平均 II 可能略低于 MATH-500（因 GPQA 推理步骤更多样化，非纯数学计算）。效应量 d_z≈0.72 介于 s015 的 ~0.55 和 MATH-500 s020 的 0.73 之间，反映 GPQA 的高方差样本特性。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Phase-stratified II statistics (GPQA s020)\"\n        columns: [phase, n_segments, n_tokens, ii_median, ii_mean, ii_ci_low, ii_ci_high]\n        rows:\n          - [high, 6261, 479658, 0.038, 0.42, 0.12, 0.95]\n          - [mid, 2185, 276409, 0.285, 1.85, 1.42, 2.35]\n          - [low, 5128, 465085, 1.98, 12.4, 10.6, 14.5]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Per-problem paired difference distribution (n=198), showing right-skewed positive distribution with 85%+ problems having positive low-high difference\"\n    analysis: \"Phase gradient 在 s020 显著（Bonferroni-corrected p < 0.001），与 MATH-500 和 GSM8K 的 s020 级别定性一致。效应量大于 GSM8K-DS s020 (0.740 median_diff) 但基于 GPQA 更长的推理链和更多 segment 采样，统计功效充分。\"\n\n  - name: \"GPQA DeepSeek Importance s025\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s025\"\n    description: \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B importance masking at s=0.25 on GPQA-Diamond (n≈198)\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      high_phase_median_ii: 0.095\n      mid_phase_median_ii: 0.72\n      low_phase_median_ii: 3.65\n      median_difference: 3.55\n      median_difference_ci: [3.05, 4.15]\n      wilcoxon_p: 8.2e-34\n      cohens_dz: 0.88\n      gradient_monotonic: true\n      perplexity_high_both: 4.2\n      perplexity_mid_both: 18.5\n      perplexity_low_both: 78.6\n    result_rationale: \"s025 是 compound interaction 显著增强的关键拐点。在 MATH-500 上 s025 median_diff=3.99，在 median 档位下 GPQA 应与 MATH-500 数值相近但略低（~3.55），因为：(1) GPQA 问题推理路径更长但每步 reasoning 深度更浅（多为知识检索+逻辑连接而非深层数学变换），导致 per-segment compound interaction 稍弱；(2) GPQA 的 perplexity landscape 更平坦（知识检索 token 的 baseline perplexity 较高），discrimination collapse 的相对影响略减。增长因子从 s015→s020 的 2× 降至 s020→s025 的 1.8×，符合 sub-exponential 预期。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Phase-stratified II statistics (GPQA s025)\"\n        columns: [phase, n_segments, n_tokens, ii_median, ii_mean, ii_ci_low, ii_ci_high]\n        rows:\n          - [high, 6261, 479658, 0.095, 0.88, 0.42, 1.52]\n          - [mid, 2185, 276409, 0.72, 5.6, 4.1, 7.8]\n          - [low, 5128, 465085, 3.65, 28.5, 22.8, 35.2]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Dose-response curve comparing GPQA vs MATH-500 vs GSM8K importance median_diff across s015-s025 (3 points), showing parallel monotonic trends with GPQA intermediate between GSM8K and MATH-500\"\n    analysis: \"s025 效应量（d_z≈0.88）进入 large 区间，GPQA gradient 在量级上接近但略低于 MATH-500（3.55 vs 3.99），这与 median 档位预期一致——GPQA 的 phase gradient 存在但 specificity magnitude 不如纯数学 benchmark。\"\n\n  - name: \"GPQA DeepSeek Importance s030\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s030\"\n    description: \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B importance masking at s=0.30 on GPQA-Diamond (n≈198), 关键指标实验\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      high_phase_median_ii: 0.18\n      mid_phase_median_ii: 1.45\n      low_phase_median_ii: 5.05\n      median_difference: 4.87\n      median_difference_ci: [3.82, 5.95]\n      wilcoxon_p: 3.1e-36\n      cohens_dz: 0.95\n      gradient_monotonic: true\n      dose_response_spearman_rho: 1.0\n      perplexity_high_both: 5.8\n      perplexity_mid_both: 32.5\n      perplexity_low_both: 145.2\n      low_high_ratio: 28.1\n    result_rationale: \"median 档位核心约束：gpqa_imp_median_diff_s030 ∈ [3.0, 6.0]。预测 4.87 落在区间中部。理由：(1) GPQA 推理链长度（~6000 tokens）意味着 low-sparsity phase 有大量 segment 累积 compound damage，但 GPQA 问题的 reasoning chain 不如 MATH-500 的逐步推导那样对 intermediate attention pattern 敏感——GPQA 更多依赖知识检索和因果推理，而非精确数值操作。(2) 从 s025→s030 增长因子约 1.4×（从 3.55 到 4.87），延续 sub-exponential 递减趋势（MATH-500 同区间增长因子 2.1×）。(3) 效应量 d_z≈0.95 接近 MATH-500 的 1.13 但未达到，因 GPQA 的 per-problem variance 更高（问题难度跨度大）。(4) 全 4 级 sparsity 构成完美单调序列（rho=1.0），确认 dose-response 在 GPQA 上成立。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"GPQA 4-level dose-response summary\"\n        columns: [sparsity, median_diff, ci_low, ci_high, cohens_dz, wilcoxon_p]\n        rows:\n          - [s015, 0.947, 0.88, 1.03, 0.55, 1.4e-29]\n          - [s020, 1.94, 1.72, 2.21, 0.72, 2.5e-28]\n          - [s025, 3.55, 3.05, 4.15, 0.88, 8.2e-34]\n          - [s030, 4.87, 3.82, 5.95, 0.95, 3.1e-36]\n      - name: \"Cross-benchmark comparison at s030\"\n        columns: [benchmark, imp_median_diff_s030, growth_factor_s025_s030]\n        rows:\n          - [MATH-500, 8.48, 2.13]\n          - [GPQA, 4.87, 1.37]\n          - [GSM8K, 4.68, 2.35]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 三 benchmark dose-response 曲线对比（MATH-500 / GPQA / GSM8K），x=sparsity level, y=importance median_diff，显示三者均单调递增但 slope 不同\"\n      - \"Fig: GPQA per-problem paired difference 分布 at s030，boxplot + violin，90%+ problems positive\"\n    analysis: \"GPQA s030 median_diff=4.87 确认 phase gradient 跨 benchmark 稳健。值得注意的是 GPQA 数值介于 GSM8K(4.68) 和 MATH-500(8.48) 之间，暗示 gradient magnitude 与 reasoning chain complexity 非简单线性关系——GPQA 链最长但 gradient 非最大。这可能因为 GPQA 的长链中包含更多'低复杂度'检索 segment，稀释了 per-token compound interaction 的影响。此发现支持 Discussion 中'specificity 与 reasoning depth/type 关系'的开放问题。\"\n\n  - name: \"GPQA DeepSeek Random s020\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_random_s020\"\n    description: \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B random masking at s=0.20 on GPQA-Diamond (n≈198), 用于计算 imp/rand ratio\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      high_phase_median_ii: 0.022\n      mid_phase_median_ii: 0.13\n      low_phase_median_ii: 0.72\n      median_difference: 0.70\n      median_difference_ci: [0.38, 1.05]\n      wilcoxon_p: 0.0035\n      cohens_dz: 0.22\n      gradient_monotonic: true\n      imp_rand_ratio_s020: 2.77\n      perplexity_high_both: 6.2\n      perplexity_mid_both: 8.5\n      perplexity_low_both: 15.8\n    result_rationale: \"median 档位核心约束：gpqa_imp_rand_ratio ∈ [2.0, 5.0]。预测 ratio=2.77（importance s020 median_diff 1.94 / random s020 median_diff 0.70）。理由：(1) 在 MATH-500 上 DeepSeek random s020 NS（median_diff≈-0.016），但在 LLaMA 上 random 所有条件显著（d_z=0.41-0.46）——GPQA 更长的推理链提供更多 statistical power 和更多 low-sparsity segment 让 random masking 的 compound effect 也能积累到可检测水平。(2) GSM8K imp/rand ratio 为 2.3-3.8×，GPQA 在 median 档位应与此一致（因为两者的 reasoning chain 长度更接近，都远长于 MATH-500 的短链）。(3) Random 的 phase gradient 存在但效应量小（d_z=0.22, small），与 LLaMA 上观测到的 random gradient 行为一致——进一步确认 strategy specificity 不是 all-or-nothing 而是 magnitude difference。(4) 这意味着 reviewers 的质疑成立：GPQA 上 random 也有显著 gradient，只是弱 2-3×，需要将'importance-specific'的 framing 改为'importance-dominant but not exclusive'。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"GPQA Strategy comparison at s020\"\n        columns: [strategy, median_diff, cohens_dz, p_value, significant]\n        rows:\n          - [importance, 1.94, 0.72, 2.5e-28, true]\n          - [random, 0.70, 0.22, 0.0035, true]\n          - [ratio, 2.77, \"-\", \"-\", \"-\"]\n      - name: \"Cross-benchmark imp/rand ratio comparison\"\n        columns: [benchmark, ratio_range, random_significant_at_s020]\n        rows:\n          - [MATH-500 (DS), 15-17×, \"No (NS)\"]\n          - [GSM8K (DS), 2.3-3.8×, \"Marginal\"]\n          - [GPQA (DS), 2.5-3.5×, \"Yes (p<0.005)\"]\n          - [LLaMA cross-arch, 2.0-2.6×, \"Yes (all conditions)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: GPQA importance vs random phase gradient 对比 bar chart，显示两者均为正但 importance ~3× 更强\"\n      - \"Fig: Strategy specificity ratio 跨 benchmark 汇总图，showing MATH-500 outlier (15-17×) vs GPQA/GSM8K/LLaMA cluster (2-5×)\"\n    analysis: \"GPQA random s020 显著（p<0.005）且 gradient 方向与 importance 一致，但效应量仅为 importance 的 1/3。这与 LLaMA cross-arch 结果（ratio 2.0-2.6×）和 GSM8K（2.3-3.8×）高度一致，强化了'MATH-500 的 15-17× ratio 是 outlier 而非 norm'的结论。Strategy specificity 成为 established pattern (task-dependent) 而非 isolated anomaly——具体来说，需要短推理链 + 高精度数学计算 + Qwen2 架构才能产生极端 ratio。这要求论文将 C1 claim 拆分并加 qualifier：phase gradient universality (strong) vs specificity magnitude (qualified, driven by task×architecture interaction)。\"\n\n  - name: \"GPQA Cross-benchmark Gradient Correlation\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_cross_benchmark_correlation\"\n    description: \"计算 GPQA importance gradient 与 MATH-500/GSM8K gradient 的跨 benchmark 相关性\"\n    expected_results:\n      spearman_rho_gpqa_vs_math500: 1.0\n      spearman_rho_gpqa_vs_gsm8k: 1.0\n      cross_benchmark_gradient_correlation: 0.92\n      gradient_slope_ratio_gpqa_vs_math500: 0.57\n      gradient_slope_ratio_gpqa_vs_gsm8k: 1.04\n    result_rationale: \"median 档位约束 cross_benchmark_gradient_correlation ∈ [0.85, 0.95]。预测 0.92：三个 benchmark 的 4-level dose-response 均为完美单调（Spearman ρ=1.0 each），但 absolute magnitude 和 growth rate 不同。Pearson correlation on log-scale gradient magnitudes 给出 0.92（低于 1.0 因为 growth factor 的 benchmark-specific 差异：MATH-500 growth 3.8→4.8→2.1，GPQA growth 2.0→1.8→1.4，GSM8K growth 3.1→2.7→2.4）。这意味着 phase gradient 的定性模式（方向+单调性）完全 universal，但定量曲线形状 task-dependent——sufficient for 'phase gradient universality' strong claim，但 slope/curvature 需加 qualifier。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"4-level gradient comparison across benchmarks (DeepSeek importance)\"\n        columns: [sparsity, MATH-500, GPQA, GSM8K]\n        rows:\n          - [s015, 0.39, 0.947, 0.241]\n          - [s020, 1.21, 1.94, 0.740]\n          - [s025, 3.99, 3.55, 1.992]\n          - [s030, 8.48, 4.87, 4.682]\n      - name: \"Growth factors between adjacent levels\"\n        columns: [transition, MATH-500, GPQA, GSM8K]\n        rows:\n          - [s015→s020, 3.1×, 2.0×, 3.1×]\n          - [s020→s025, 3.3×, 1.8×, 2.7×]\n          - [s025→s030, 2.1×, 1.4×, 2.4×]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Three-panel dose-response with shared y-axis (log scale), showing parallel but non-identical curves; MATH-500 steepest, GPQA flattest at high sparsity\"\n    analysis: \"跨 benchmark 相关性 0.92 支持 phase gradient universality 的 strong claim。但 GPQA 的 sub-exponential decay 明显快于 MATH-500（s025→s030 仅 1.4× vs 2.1×），暗示 GPQA 的 reasoning 在 extreme sparsity 下可能已接近 ceiling effect（compound interaction 饱和），而 MATH-500 的精确计算链仍有空间进一步恶化。\"\n\n  - name: \"GPQA Strategy Specificity Summary (projected)\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_strategy_specificity\"\n    description: \"汇总 GPQA 上 importance vs random 的 phase gradient 差异，计算 imp/rand ratio 跨 sparsity levels\"\n    expected_results:\n      imp_rand_ratio_s015: 3.2\n      imp_rand_ratio_s020: 2.8\n      imp_rand_ratio_s025: 3.5\n      imp_rand_ratio_s030: 2.9\n      mean_imp_rand_ratio: 3.1\n      random_significant_fraction: 0.75\n      strategy_x_phase_interaction_p: 0.008\n    result_rationale: \"median 档位约束 gpqa_imp_rand_ratio ∈ [2.0, 5.0]。预测 mean ratio=3.1，落在区间中下部。理由：(1) GPQA 长推理链给 random masking 更多机会累积 compound effect，缩小与 importance 的差距；(2) ratio 跨 sparsity level 相对稳定（2.8-3.5）而非随 sparsity 增大而扩大（这与 MATH-500 不同，后者 ratio 从 s015 的 28× 到 s030 的 17× 虽在缩小但始终极端）；(3) random 在多数条件下显著（3/4 significant after Bonferroni），与 LLaMA 行为模式一致而非 MATH-500-DeepSeek 的 random-NS 模式。(4) Strategy×phase 交互仍显著（p<0.01）但 F 值远小于 MATH-500 的版本，Reviewers 会接受 interaction 存在但要求 magnitude 相关 claims 加 qualifier。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"GPQA imp/rand ratio by sparsity level\"\n        columns: [sparsity, imp_median_diff, rand_median_diff, ratio, rand_significant]\n        rows:\n          - [s015, 0.947, 0.30, 3.2, \"marginal (p=0.04)\"]\n          - [s020, 1.94, 0.70, 2.8, \"yes (p=0.004)\"]\n          - [s025, 3.55, 1.01, 3.5, \"yes (p<0.001)\"]\n          - [s030, 4.87, 1.68, 2.9, \"yes (p<0.001)\"]\n      - name: \"Strategy specificity across all benchmarks\"\n        columns: [benchmark, mean_ratio, ratio_range, pattern]\n        rows:\n          - [MATH-500 (DS n=500), 22.4, 15.5-38.6×, \"random NS at s015/s020; extreme separation\"]\n          - [GSM8K (DS n=50), 2.9, 2.3-3.8×, \"random gradient exists but weaker\"]\n          - [GPQA (DS n=198), 3.1, 2.8-3.5×, \"random mostly significant; moderate separation\"]\n          - [LLaMA cross-arch (n=250), 2.3, 2.0-2.6×, \"random all significant; minimal separation\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Heatmap of imp/rand ratios (rows=benchmark, cols=sparsity), color-coded to show MATH-500 as clear outlier\"\n      - \"Fig: Forest plot of strategy×phase interaction effect sizes across benchmarks/architectures\"\n    analysis: \"GPQA ratio 3.1 与 GSM8K (2.9) 和 LLaMA (2.3) 形成 cluster，远离 MATH-500 (22.4) 的离群值。这确立了'strategy specificity magnitude is task-dependent'作为 robust pattern 而非 isolated observation。Reviewers 会认可 phase gradient universality 但要求将 specificity claim 降调。Discussion 需新增段落分析 possible mechanism：MATH-500 的极端 ratio 可能源于数学计算的 attention pattern 高度结构化（特定 head 专注于操作数关系），使 importance eviction 造成的 discrimination collapse 影响远大于 random 的 uniform damage；而 GPQA/GSM8K 的推理更多依赖分布式知识表示，两种 eviction 造成的损伤更均匀。\"\n\n  - name: \"Expected Reviewer Scores (median tier)\"\n    plan_id: \"reviewer_score_projection\"\n    description: \"基于 GPQA 结果和完整证据链预测 reviewer 评分\"\n    expected_results:\n      reviewer_1_score: 3.5\n      reviewer_2_score: 3.0\n      reviewer_3_score: 3.5\n      average_score: 3.33\n      novelty_score: 3.25\n      soundness_score: 3.5\n      significance_score: 3.0\n      clarity_score: 3.5\n    result_rationale: \"median 档位约束 expected_reviewer_avg_score ∈ [3.0, 3.5], novelty_score ∈ [3.0, 3.5]。Reviewer 1（方法论专家）给 3.5：认可 recency control 的 experimental design contribution 和 triple dissociation 的清晰性，但对 7B-only scale 有轻微保留。Reviewer 2（efficiency/systems 方向）给 3.0：认可 finding 的 empirical rigor 但质疑'so what'——phase gradient 的 practical implication 不够清晰，C5b mitigation pilot 失败削弱了 impact story。Reviewer 3（NLP/reasoning 方向）给 3.5：对 cross-benchmark 分析和 task-dependent specificity 的 open question framing 表示欣赏，认为这为 future work 打开了有意义的方向。共同关注点：(a) specificity claim 需要 qualifier（全部三人），(b) 7B scale limitation（2/3），(c) architecture dependence 需更多讨论（1/3）。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Projected reviewer feedback summary\"\n        columns: [aspect, consensus, dissent]\n        rows:\n          - [phase gradient universality, \"accepted (strong evidence)\", \"none\"]\n          - [strategy specificity magnitude, \"requires qualifier\", \"R2 wants this demoted to secondary finding\"]\n          - [recency control novelty, \"recognized as contribution\", \"R2 questions if methodological innovation warrants inclusion\"]\n          - [7B scale limitation, \"acknowledged in limitations\", \"R1 suggests at least one 13B+ data point\"]\n          - [architecture dependence, \"interesting open question\", \"R3 wants more mechanistic speculation\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Average 3.33 is borderline accept at EMNLP。关键 rebuttal 策略：(1) 强调 phase gradient universality 的 unprecedented evidence breadth (3 benchmarks × 3 architectures × 4 sparsity levels)；(2) 主动承认 specificity is task-dependent 并 frame 为 positive contribution（发现了影响 specificity 的 factors，不是 limitation 而是 nuanced understanding）；(3) 对 R2 的 practical impact concern，指向 recency control 作为 future phase-aware system design 的基础。\"\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":58954,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":58954},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"af012c02-0c3e-48c5-9960-80f13c9bc09d","uuid":"595e89e5-8040-4d0b-9494-45690ec70e52"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":183342,"duration_api_ms":184958,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: \"核心 finding (phase-dependent severity) 跨 GPQA 稳健复现，dose-response 单调递增 (ρ=1.0)。但 strategy specificity magnitude 从 MATH-500 的 15-17× 衰减至 GPQA 的 2-5×（与 GSM8K 同量级），确认 specificity 强度是 task-dependent 而非 universal constant。需将论文 C1 claim 拆分为 (a) phase gradient universality (strong, fully supported across 3 benchmarks) 和 (b) strategy specificity magnitude (qualified, context-dependent)。\"\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"GPQA DeepSeek Importance s020\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s020\"\n    description: \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B importance masking at s=0.20 on GPQA-Diamond (n≈198), measuring per-problem paired phase gradient\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      high_phase_median_ii: 0.038\n      mid_phase_median_ii: 0.285\n      low_phase_median_ii: 1.98\n      median_difference: 1.94\n      median_difference_ci: [1.72, 2.21]\n      wilcoxon_p: 2.5e-28\n      cohens_dz: 0.72\n      gradient_monotonic: true\n      perplexity_high_both: 2.85\n      perplexity_mid_both: 7.9\n      perplexity_low_both: 42.3\n    result_rationale: \"在 median 档位下，GPQA importance phase gradient 延续 s015 的强单调趋势。s015 已观测到 median_diff=0.947，s020 按 sub-exponential growth（约 2× 增长因子）预期达到 ~1.9。GPQA 推理链更长（平均 ~6000 tokens vs MATH-500 ~1200），低 sparsity phase 累积更多 compound interaction，但每 segment 平均 II 可能略低于 MATH-500（因 GPQA 推理步骤更多样化，非纯数学计算）。效应量 d_z≈0.72 介于 s015 的 ~0.55 和 MATH-500 s020 的 0.73 之间，反映 GPQA 的高方差样本特性。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Phase-stratified II statistics (GPQA s020)\"\n        columns: [phase, n_segments, n_tokens, ii_median, ii_mean, ii_ci_low, ii_ci_high]\n        rows:\n          - [high, 6261, 479658, 0.038, 0.42, 0.12, 0.95]\n          - [mid, 2185, 276409, 0.285, 1.85, 1.42, 2.35]\n          - [low, 5128, 465085, 1.98, 12.4, 10.6, 14.5]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Per-problem paired difference distribution (n=198), showing right-skewed positive distribution with 85%+ problems having positive low-high difference\"\n    analysis: \"Phase gradient 在 s020 显著（Bonferroni-corrected p < 0.001），与 MATH-500 和 GSM8K 的 s020 级别定性一致。效应量大于 GSM8K-DS s020 (0.740 median_diff) 但基于 GPQA 更长的推理链和更多 segment 采样，统计功效充分。\"\n\n  - name: \"GPQA DeepSeek Importance s025\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s025\"\n    description: \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B importance masking at s=0.25 on GPQA-Diamond (n≈198)\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      high_phase_median_ii: 0.095\n      mid_phase_median_ii: 0.72\n      low_phase_median_ii: 3.65\n      median_difference: 3.55\n      median_difference_ci: [3.05, 4.15]\n      wilcoxon_p: 8.2e-34\n      cohens_dz: 0.88\n      gradient_monotonic: true\n      perplexity_high_both: 4.2\n      perplexity_mid_both: 18.5\n      perplexity_low_both: 78.6\n    result_rationale: \"s025 是 compound interaction 显著增强的关键拐点。在 MATH-500 上 s025 median_diff=3.99，在 median 档位下 GPQA 应与 MATH-500 数值相近但略低（~3.55），因为：(1) GPQA 问题推理路径更长但每步 reasoning 深度更浅（多为知识检索+逻辑连接而非深层数学变换），导致 per-segment compound interaction 稍弱；(2) GPQA 的 perplexity landscape 更平坦（知识检索 token 的 baseline perplexity 较高），discrimination collapse 的相对影响略减。增长因子从 s015→s020 的 2× 降至 s020→s025 的 1.8×，符合 sub-exponential 预期。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Phase-stratified II statistics (GPQA s025)\"\n        columns: [phase, n_segments, n_tokens, ii_median, ii_mean, ii_ci_low, ii_ci_high]\n        rows:\n          - [high, 6261, 479658, 0.095, 0.88, 0.42, 1.52]\n          - [mid, 2185, 276409, 0.72, 5.6, 4.1, 7.8]\n          - [low, 5128, 465085, 3.65, 28.5, 22.8, 35.2]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Dose-response curve comparing GPQA vs MATH-500 vs GSM8K importance median_diff across s015-s025 (3 points), showing parallel monotonic trends with GPQA intermediate between GSM8K and MATH-500\"\n    analysis: \"s025 效应量（d_z≈0.88）进入 large 区间，GPQA gradient 在量级上接近但略低于 MATH-500（3.55 vs 3.99），这与 median 档位预期一致——GPQA 的 phase gradient 存在但 specificity magnitude 不如纯数学 benchmark。\"\n\n  - name: \"GPQA DeepSeek Importance s030\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s030\"\n    description: \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B importance masking at s=0.30 on GPQA-Diamond (n≈198), 关键指标实验\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      high_phase_median_ii: 0.18\n      mid_phase_median_ii: 1.45\n      low_phase_median_ii: 5.05\n      median_difference: 4.87\n      median_difference_ci: [3.82, 5.95]\n      wilcoxon_p: 3.1e-36\n      cohens_dz: 0.95\n      gradient_monotonic: true\n      dose_response_spearman_rho: 1.0\n      perplexity_high_both: 5.8\n      perplexity_mid_both: 32.5\n      perplexity_low_both: 145.2\n      low_high_ratio: 28.1\n    result_rationale: \"median 档位核心约束：gpqa_imp_median_diff_s030 ∈ [3.0, 6.0]。预测 4.87 落在区间中部。理由：(1) GPQA 推理链长度（~6000 tokens）意味着 low-sparsity phase 有大量 segment 累积 compound damage，但 GPQA 问题的 reasoning chain 不如 MATH-500 的逐步推导那样对 intermediate attention pattern 敏感——GPQA 更多依赖知识检索和因果推理，而非精确数值操作。(2) 从 s025→s030 增长因子约 1.4×（从 3.55 到 4.87），延续 sub-exponential 递减趋势（MATH-500 同区间增长因子 2.1×）。(3) 效应量 d_z≈0.95 接近 MATH-500 的 1.13 但未达到，因 GPQA 的 per-problem variance 更高（问题难度跨度大）。(4) 全 4 级 sparsity 构成完美单调序列（rho=1.0），确认 dose-response 在 GPQA 上成立。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"GPQA 4-level dose-response summary\"\n        columns: [sparsity, median_diff, ci_low, ci_high, cohens_dz, wilcoxon_p]\n        rows:\n          - [s015, 0.947, 0.88, 1.03, 0.55, 1.4e-29]\n          - [s020, 1.94, 1.72, 2.21, 0.72, 2.5e-28]\n          - [s025, 3.55, 3.05, 4.15, 0.88, 8.2e-34]\n          - [s030, 4.87, 3.82, 5.95, 0.95, 3.1e-36]\n      - name: \"Cross-benchmark comparison at s030\"\n        columns: [benchmark, imp_median_diff_s030, growth_factor_s025_s030]\n        rows:\n          - [MATH-500, 8.48, 2.13]\n          - [GPQA, 4.87, 1.37]\n          - [GSM8K, 4.68, 2.35]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 三 benchmark dose-response 曲线对比（MATH-500 / GPQA / GSM8K），x=sparsity level, y=importance median_diff，显示三者均单调递增但 slope 不同\"\n      - \"Fig: GPQA per-problem paired difference 分布 at s030，boxplot + violin，90%+ problems positive\"\n    analysis: \"GPQA s030 median_diff=4.87 确认 phase gradient 跨 benchmark 稳健。值得注意的是 GPQA 数值介于 GSM8K(4.68) 和 MATH-500(8.48) 之间，暗示 gradient magnitude 与 reasoning chain complexity 非简单线性关系——GPQA 链最长但 gradient 非最大。这可能因为 GPQA 的长链中包含更多'低复杂度'检索 segment，稀释了 per-token compound interaction 的影响。此发现支持 Discussion 中'specificity 与 reasoning depth/type 关系'的开放问题。\"\n\n  - name: \"GPQA DeepSeek Random s020\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_random_s020\"\n    description: \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B random masking at s=0.20 on GPQA-Diamond (n≈198), 用于计算 imp/rand ratio\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      high_phase_median_ii: 0.022\n      mid_phase_median_ii: 0.13\n      low_phase_median_ii: 0.72\n      median_difference: 0.70\n      median_difference_ci: [0.38, 1.05]\n      wilcoxon_p: 0.0035\n      cohens_dz: 0.22\n      gradient_monotonic: true\n      imp_rand_ratio_s020: 2.77\n      perplexity_high_both: 6.2\n      perplexity_mid_both: 8.5\n      perplexity_low_both: 15.8\n    result_rationale: \"median 档位核心约束：gpqa_imp_rand_ratio ∈ [2.0, 5.0]。预测 ratio=2.77（importance s020 median_diff 1.94 / random s020 median_diff 0.70）。理由：(1) 在 MATH-500 上 DeepSeek random s020 NS（median_diff≈-0.016），但在 LLaMA 上 random 所有条件显著（d_z=0.41-0.46）——GPQA 更长的推理链提供更多 statistical power 和更多 low-sparsity segment 让 random masking 的 compound effect 也能积累到可检测水平。(2) GSM8K imp/rand ratio 为 2.3-3.8×，GPQA 在 median 档位应与此一致（因为两者的 reasoning chain 长度更接近，都远长于 MATH-500 的短链）。(3) Random 的 phase gradient 存在但效应量小（d_z=0.22, small），与 LLaMA 上观测到的 random gradient 行为一致——进一步确认 strategy specificity 不是 all-or-nothing 而是 magnitude difference。(4) 这意味着 reviewers 的质疑成立：GPQA 上 random 也有显著 gradient，只是弱 2-3×，需要将'importance-specific'的 framing 改为'importance-dominant but not exclusive'。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"GPQA Strategy comparison at s020\"\n        columns: [strategy, median_diff, cohens_dz, p_value, significant]\n        rows:\n          - [importance, 1.94, 0.72, 2.5e-28, true]\n          - [random, 0.70, 0.22, 0.0035, true]\n          - [ratio, 2.77, \"-\", \"-\", \"-\"]\n      - name: \"Cross-benchmark imp/rand ratio comparison\"\n        columns: [benchmark, ratio_range, random_significant_at_s020]\n        rows:\n          - [MATH-500 (DS), 15-17×, \"No (NS)\"]\n          - [GSM8K (DS), 2.3-3.8×, \"Marginal\"]\n          - [GPQA (DS), 2.5-3.5×, \"Yes (p<0.005)\"]\n          - [LLaMA cross-arch, 2.0-2.6×, \"Yes (all conditions)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: GPQA importance vs random phase gradient 对比 bar chart，显示两者均为正但 importance ~3× 更强\"\n      - \"Fig: Strategy specificity ratio 跨 benchmark 汇总图，showing MATH-500 outlier (15-17×) vs GPQA/GSM8K/LLaMA cluster (2-5×)\"\n    analysis: \"GPQA random s020 显著（p<0.005）且 gradient 方向与 importance 一致，但效应量仅为 importance 的 1/3。这与 LLaMA cross-arch 结果（ratio 2.0-2.6×）和 GSM8K（2.3-3.8×）高度一致，强化了'MATH-500 的 15-17× ratio 是 outlier 而非 norm'的结论。Strategy specificity 成为 established pattern (task-dependent) 而非 isolated anomaly——具体来说，需要短推理链 + 高精度数学计算 + Qwen2 架构才能产生极端 ratio。这要求论文将 C1 claim 拆分并加 qualifier：phase gradient universality (strong) vs specificity magnitude (qualified, driven by task×architecture interaction)。\"\n\n  - name: \"GPQA Cross-benchmark Gradient Correlation\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_cross_benchmark_correlation\"\n    description: \"计算 GPQA importance gradient 与 MATH-500/GSM8K gradient 的跨 benchmark 相关性\"\n    expected_results:\n      spearman_rho_gpqa_vs_math500: 1.0\n      spearman_rho_gpqa_vs_gsm8k: 1.0\n      cross_benchmark_gradient_correlation: 0.92\n      gradient_slope_ratio_gpqa_vs_math500: 0.57\n      gradient_slope_ratio_gpqa_vs_gsm8k: 1.04\n    result_rationale: \"median 档位约束 cross_benchmark_gradient_correlation ∈ [0.85, 0.95]。预测 0.92：三个 benchmark 的 4-level dose-response 均为完美单调（Spearman ρ=1.0 each），但 absolute magnitude 和 growth rate 不同。Pearson correlation on log-scale gradient magnitudes 给出 0.92（低于 1.0 因为 growth factor 的 benchmark-specific 差异：MATH-500 growth 3.8→4.8→2.1，GPQA growth 2.0→1.8→1.4，GSM8K growth 3.1→2.7→2.4）。这意味着 phase gradient 的定性模式（方向+单调性）完全 universal，但定量曲线形状 task-dependent——sufficient for 'phase gradient universality' strong claim，但 slope/curvature 需加 qualifier。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"4-level gradient comparison across benchmarks (DeepSeek importance)\"\n        columns: [sparsity, MATH-500, GPQA, GSM8K]\n        rows:\n          - [s015, 0.39, 0.947, 0.241]\n          - [s020, 1.21, 1.94, 0.740]\n          - [s025, 3.99, 3.55, 1.992]\n          - [s030, 8.48, 4.87, 4.682]\n      - name: \"Growth factors between adjacent levels\"\n        columns: [transition, MATH-500, GPQA, GSM8K]\n        rows:\n          - [s015→s020, 3.1×, 2.0×, 3.1×]\n          - [s020→s025, 3.3×, 1.8×, 2.7×]\n          - [s025→s030, 2.1×, 1.4×, 2.4×]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Three-panel dose-response with shared y-axis (log scale), showing parallel but non-identical curves; MATH-500 steepest, GPQA flattest at high sparsity\"\n    analysis: \"跨 benchmark 相关性 0.92 支持 phase gradient universality 的 strong claim。但 GPQA 的 sub-exponential decay 明显快于 MATH-500（s025→s030 仅 1.4× vs 2.1×），暗示 GPQA 的 reasoning 在 extreme sparsity 下可能已接近 ceiling effect（compound interaction 饱和），而 MATH-500 的精确计算链仍有空间进一步恶化。\"\n\n  - name: \"GPQA Strategy Specificity Summary (projected)\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_strategy_specificity\"\n    description: \"汇总 GPQA 上 importance vs random 的 phase gradient 差异，计算 imp/rand ratio 跨 sparsity levels\"\n    expected_results:\n      imp_rand_ratio_s015: 3.2\n      imp_rand_ratio_s020: 2.8\n      imp_rand_ratio_s025: 3.5\n      imp_rand_ratio_s030: 2.9\n      mean_imp_rand_ratio: 3.1\n      random_significant_fraction: 0.75\n      strategy_x_phase_interaction_p: 0.008\n    result_rationale: \"median 档位约束 gpqa_imp_rand_ratio ∈ [2.0, 5.0]。预测 mean ratio=3.1，落在区间中下部。理由：(1) GPQA 长推理链给 random masking 更多机会累积 compound effect，缩小与 importance 的差距；(2) ratio 跨 sparsity level 相对稳定（2.8-3.5）而非随 sparsity 增大而扩大（这与 MATH-500 不同，后者 ratio 从 s015 的 28× 到 s030 的 17× 虽在缩小但始终极端）；(3) random 在多数条件下显著（3/4 significant after Bonferroni），与 LLaMA 行为模式一致而非 MATH-500-DeepSeek 的 random-NS 模式。(4) Strategy×phase 交互仍显著（p<0.01）但 F 值远小于 MATH-500 的版本，Reviewers 会接受 interaction 存在但要求 magnitude 相关 claims 加 qualifier。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"GPQA imp/rand ratio by sparsity level\"\n        columns: [sparsity, imp_median_diff, rand_median_diff, ratio, rand_significant]\n        rows:\n          - [s015, 0.947, 0.30, 3.2, \"marginal (p=0.04)\"]\n          - [s020, 1.94, 0.70, 2.8, \"yes (p=0.004)\"]\n          - [s025, 3.55, 1.01, 3.5, \"yes (p<0.001)\"]\n          - [s030, 4.87, 1.68, 2.9, \"yes (p<0.001)\"]\n      - name: \"Strategy specificity across all benchmarks\"\n        columns: [benchmark, mean_ratio, ratio_range, pattern]\n        rows:\n          - [MATH-500 (DS n=500), 22.4, 15.5-38.6×, \"random NS at s015/s020; extreme separation\"]\n          - [GSM8K (DS n=50), 2.9, 2.3-3.8×, \"random gradient exists but weaker\"]\n          - [GPQA (DS n=198), 3.1, 2.8-3.5×, \"random mostly significant; moderate separation\"]\n          - [LLaMA cross-arch (n=250), 2.3, 2.0-2.6×, \"random all significant; minimal separation\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Heatmap of imp/rand ratios (rows=benchmark, cols=sparsity), color-coded to show MATH-500 as clear outlier\"\n      - \"Fig: Forest plot of strategy×phase interaction effect sizes across benchmarks/architectures\"\n    analysis: \"GPQA ratio 3.1 与 GSM8K (2.9) 和 LLaMA (2.3) 形成 cluster，远离 MATH-500 (22.4) 的离群值。这确立了'strategy specificity magnitude is task-dependent'作为 robust pattern 而非 isolated observation。Reviewers 会认可 phase gradient universality 但要求将 specificity claim 降调。Discussion 需新增段落分析 possible mechanism：MATH-500 的极端 ratio 可能源于数学计算的 attention pattern 高度结构化（特定 head 专注于操作数关系），使 importance eviction 造成的 discrimination collapse 影响远大于 random 的 uniform damage；而 GPQA/GSM8K 的推理更多依赖分布式知识表示，两种 eviction 造成的损伤更均匀。\"\n\n  - name: \"Expected Reviewer Scores (median tier)\"\n    plan_id: \"reviewer_score_projection\"\n    description: \"基于 GPQA 结果和完整证据链预测 reviewer 评分\"\n    expected_results:\n      reviewer_1_score: 3.5\n      reviewer_2_score: 3.0\n      reviewer_3_score: 3.5\n      average_score: 3.33\n      novelty_score: 3.25\n      soundness_score: 3.5\n      significance_score: 3.0\n      clarity_score: 3.5\n    result_rationale: \"median 档位约束 expected_reviewer_avg_score ∈ [3.0, 3.5], novelty_score ∈ [3.0, 3.5]。Reviewer 1（方法论专家）给 3.5：认可 recency control 的 experimental design contribution 和 triple dissociation 的清晰性，但对 7B-only scale 有轻微保留。Reviewer 2（efficiency/systems 方向）给 3.0：认可 finding 的 empirical rigor 但质疑'so what'——phase gradient 的 practical implication 不够清晰，C5b mitigation pilot 失败削弱了 impact story。Reviewer 3（NLP/reasoning 方向）给 3.5：对 cross-benchmark 分析和 task-dependent specificity 的 open question framing 表示欣赏，认为这为 future work 打开了有意义的方向。共同关注点：(a) specificity claim 需要 qualifier（全部三人），(b) 7B scale limitation（2/3），(c) architecture dependence 需更多讨论（1/3）。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Projected reviewer feedback summary\"\n        columns: [aspect, consensus, dissent]\n        rows:\n          - [phase gradient universality, \"accepted (strong evidence)\", \"none\"]\n          - [strategy specificity magnitude, \"requires qualifier\", \"R2 wants this demoted to secondary finding\"]\n          - [recency control novelty, \"recognized as contribution\", \"R2 questions if methodological innovation warrants inclusion\"]\n          - [7B scale limitation, \"acknowledged in limitations\", \"R1 suggests at least one 13B+ data point\"]\n          - [architecture dependence, \"interesting open question\", \"R3 wants more mechanistic speculation\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Average 3.33 is borderline accept at EMNLP。关键 rebuttal 策略：(1) 强调 phase gradient universality 的 unprecedented evidence breadth (3 benchmarks × 3 architectures × 4 sparsity levels)；(2) 主动承认 specificity is task-dependent 并 frame 为 positive contribution（发现了影响 specificity 的 factors，不是 limitation 而是 nuanced understanding）；(3) 对 R2 的 practical impact concern，指向 recency control 作为 future phase-aware system design 的基础。\"\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"af012c02-0c3e-48c5-9960-80f13c9bc09d","total_cost_usd":0.658551,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":58954,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":9205,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":58954,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":9205,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":58954,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":58954},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":53918,"outputTokens":23,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.054033,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":9205,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":58954,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.604518,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"44bbed80-3538-47b4-b613-2605e689bedb"}
